<div class="landing">
  <h1>Collective Player Games</h1>

  <div class="concept">
    <p>
      In most multiplayer games, each person controls their own character.
      In <strong>collective-player games</strong>, several people jointly control a
      single character &mdash; many hands, one player.
    </p>
    <p>
      Each game here uses some mechanism &mdash; voting, aggregation, sampling
      &mdash; to combine individual inputs into a single group action.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>Games</h2>
  <ul class="game-list">
    <li>
      <a href="/ggc" class="game-card">
        <h3>Group Group Chat</h3>
        <p>Two groups have a conversation. Each group composes its messages one word at a time, by anonymous vote.</p>
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>
